# SEQ-BONE-KEYS: bone transform keys in the Level Sequencer, layered over the Animation track (UE FK Control Rig).
# Committed content: Sequences/SEQ_BoneKeys.dseq binds Hero (3001) and Twin (3002) of SEQ_BoneKeys.desce, each with an Idle Animation section 0-3 s; the scene's BoneKeysSequence actor (3003) plays it in Play (AutoPlay, Once). Not saved.
# Humanoid's bones are Hips..Head, Shoulder.L.. (Editor/Resources/Engine/Meshes/Skinned/Humanoid.skeleton).
# A document value is a number: Bone.<actor>.<bone>.Blend is 0 Absolute, 1 Additive; Rotation is Euler degrees (pitch, yaw, roll) and KEYS the channel at the playhead (one undo step each).
# UpdateRate is not a settable field (AnimationComponent::UpdateRate is transient, set from screen size): the scene's Play camera stands 800 cm back so Hero's screen size falls in the 0.2-0.4 band, rate 2 (kUpdateRateBands); the [SkinnedLOD] log line proves the rate.
Проект Projects/Desert/Desert.deproj --scene Content/Scenes/SEQ_BoneKeys.desce
Дано run View "View mode: Lit"
Дано run Open "Sequences/SEQ_BoneKeys.dseq"
# The editor camera faces both humanoids from the front, at head height (Hero x=-75, Twin x=75; the Play camera looks down -Z from z=800, so the humanoids face +Z).
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Position 0,165,230
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0,-0.08,-0.997
# [1_base] no bone tracks: both play idle, heads forward.
Когда set Transport.Time 1.0
Когда 10 frames render
Тогда-вид 1_base both humanoids stand in idle, heads facing the camera, arms down; identical poses
# [2_absolute] Hero head yaw 45 deg, absolute, weight 1 (edits 1-2).
Когда run Document "SEQ_BoneKeys: Add Bone Track Hero Head"
Когда 1 frames render
Когда set Bone.Hero.Head.Rotation 0,45,0
Когда 10 frames render
Тогда-вид 2_absolute Hero's head is turned about 45 deg to its left, body still in idle; Twin's head faces the camera (same bone name, other actor untouched); the Sequencer shows a Head row under Hero with a key at 1.0 s
# [2_absolute] check: the chunk errors (the step is refused, the run stops) unless the values hold.
Когда lua "local h = World.find('Hero'):boneLocalRotation('Head'); local t = World.find('Twin'):boneLocalRotation('Head'); assert(math.abs(h.y - 45) <= 0.5, string.format('2_absolute: Hero Head yaw %.2f, expected 45', h.y)); assert(math.abs(t.y - 45) > 20, string.format('2_absolute: Twin Head yaw %.2f follows the key', t.y))"
# [3_weight] weight 0.5 blends with the idle pose, not with zero (edit 3).
Когда set Bone.Hero.Head.Weight 0.5
Когда 10 frames render
Тогда-вид 3_weight Hero's head is turned about half as far as in 2_absolute (~22 deg), not drooped or collapsed
Когда lua "local h = World.find('Hero'):boneLocalRotation('Head'); local t = World.find('Twin'):boneLocalRotation('Head'); assert(h.y > 15 and h.y < 30, string.format('3_weight: Hero Head yaw %.2f, expected ~22.5', h.y))"
# [4_additive] additive 15 deg over idle: the idle breathing still moves the head (edits 4-6).
Когда set Bone.Hero.Head.Weight 1.0
Когда set Bone.Hero.Head.Blend 1
Когда set Bone.Hero.Head.Rotation 0,15,0
Когда 10 frames render
Тогда-вид 4_additive Hero's head turned slightly (~15 deg) to its left on top of idle; arms and torso as in 1_base
Когда lua "local h = World.find('Hero'):boneLocalRotation('Head'); local t = World.find('Twin'):boneLocalRotation('Head'); assert(math.abs((h.y - t.y) - 15) <= 1, string.format('4_additive: Hero-Twin Head yaw %.2f, expected 15 over idle', h.y - t.y))"
# [5_scrub] scrub away and back: same frame.
Когда set Transport.Time 0.0
Когда 1 frames render
Когда set Transport.Time 1.0
Когда 10 frames render
Тогда-вид 5_scrub identical to 4_additive (pixel diff only in idle-free regions = 0)
# [6_play] step key: 0 deg at t=0 and 45 deg at t=1, both Constant (edits 7-10); Play runs the BoneKeysSequence actor at UpdateRate 2.
Когда set Bone.Hero.Head.Blend 0
Когда set Transport.Time 0.0
Когда 1 frames render
Когда set Bone.Hero.Head.Rotation 0,0,0
Когда set Transport.Time 1.0
Когда 1 frames render
Когда set Bone.Hero.Head.Rotation 0,45,0
Когда run Document "SEQ_BoneKeys: Select All Keys"
Когда run Document "SEQ_BoneKeys: Set Key Interp Constant"
Когда 1 frames render
Когда run Action Play
Когда advance 0.5
# [6_play_hold] Constant holds the first key at t=0.5, not 22.5.
Когда lua "local h = World.find('Hero'):boneLocalRotation('Head'); local t = World.find('Twin'):boneLocalRotation('Head'); assert(math.abs(h.y) <= 0.5, string.format('6_play_hold: Hero Head yaw %.2f at t=0.5, expected 0', h.y))"
Когда advance 0.6
# [6_play] the key took on the first frame past 1.0 s; by hand: editor.log has a "[SkinnedLOD]" line for Hero with rate 2 during Play and no "holds them already" (the preview released its layer at Play start).
Когда lua "local h = World.find('Hero'):boneLocalRotation('Head'); local t = World.find('Twin'):boneLocalRotation('Head'); assert(math.abs(h.y - 45) <= 0.5, string.format('6_play: Hero Head yaw %.2f at t=1.1, expected 45', h.y)); assert(math.abs(t.y - 45) > 20, string.format('6_play: Twin Head yaw %.2f follows the key', t.y))"
Тогда-вид 6_play Hero's head turned ~45 deg to its left (the game camera, 800 cm back); Twin's head forward
# [7_stop] leaving Play takes the actor's layer off; the Sequencer preview poses the editor scene again at its playhead.
Когда run Action Stop
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Position 0,165,230
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0,-0.08,-0.997
Когда 10 frames render
Тогда-вид 7_stop Hero's head turned ~45 deg as the Sequencer playhead (1.0 s) shows; Twin's head forward; no "holds them already" refusal in editor.log
# [8_undo] undo every edit (10): the bone track is gone, Hero in idle.
Когда run Action Undo
Когда run Action Undo
Когда run Action Undo
Когда run Action Undo
Когда run Action Undo
Когда run Action Undo
Когда run Action Undo
Когда run Action Undo
Когда run Action Undo
Когда run Action Undo
Когда 10 frames render
Тогда-вид 8_undo Sequencer has no Head row under Hero; Hero and Twin in the identical Idle pose, as in 1_base
# [9_refused] a bone the rig lacks is refused by name; the step EXPECTS the refusal (DesertCtl --expect-refusal: the run goes on, the reason is kept in the run log). No "Add Bone Track Hero tail_01" action exists: the menu lists the skeleton's bones.
Когда --expect-refusal set Bone.Hero.tail_01.Rotation 0,10,0
Тогда 9_refused the toast/Output Log names "tail_01" and Hero's skeleton ("the skeleton of Hero has no such bone"); no row added under Hero; 0 VUID in editor.log
